%% Chroma Write Path Data Flow
%% Commit: 091f8bd5c553f8267c48664e98fb32215055f58e

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Client as ClientAPI
    participant API as ServerAPI<br/>(RustBindingsAPI)
    participant Producer
    participant WAL as WAL3<br/>Write-Ahead Log
    participant Consumer
    participant VectorSeg as Vector Segment<br/>(HNSW)
    participant MetaSeg as Metadata Segment<br/>(SQLite)

    User->>Client: collection.add(documents, embeddings, metadata, ids)
    Note over User,Client: Python/JS/HTTP client

    Client->>Client: Validate inputs<br/>Generate embeddings if needed
    Client->>API: _add(collection_id, ...)

    API->>API: Get collection metadata
    API->>Producer: submit_batch(records)
    Note over Producer: Async write path

    Producer->>WAL: append(records, seq_id)
    Note over WAL: Durable write with sequence ID
    WAL-->>Producer: seq_id committed

    Producer-->>API: Acknowledgement (seq_id)
    API-->>Client: Success
    Client-->>User: add() returns

    Note over Consumer,MetaSeg: Background processing (async)

    Consumer->>WAL: poll_new_records()
    WAL-->>Consumer: batch of records

    par Parallel Writes
        Consumer->>VectorSeg: add_vectors(embeddings, ids)
        VectorSeg->>VectorSeg: Insert into HNSW index
        and
        Consumer->>MetaSeg: add_metadata(metadata, ids)
        MetaSeg->>MetaSeg: INSERT INTO SQLite
    end

    VectorSeg-->>Consumer: Success
    MetaSeg-->>Consumer: Success

    Consumer->>Consumer: Update watermark (seq_id)

    Note over User,MetaSeg: Write is now queryable
